		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτά̆ρ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw out in battle-order,</i> of
